    "representation": "Remove slash and line breaks; hyphens delimit visible word slots; ignore all nonalphabet characters inside each slot.",
    "procedure": "Exact source keyword list; strip duplicate characters preserving first occurrence; alphabetic column order with original-position tie break; decrypt ragged columns with original leftmost columns longest; no wraps; one transform per page. Separate POST-TARGET calibration: 128 shared-page rune-order shuffles, rerun all 45 aggregate per-key scores and retain trial key maximum. 45 full 184-rune known-Warning planted score/rank controls use its existing decoded boundaries.",
    "parameters": "45 source labels, 43 distinct column orders; 56 pages/55 nonempty; 2,776 visible slots; 369,652 fixed dictionary entries; 1,125 permutation controls. Exploratory calibration: 128 shared-page nulls, Random seed 330145; 45 known-reading score/rank controls, separate from 1125 inverse tests.",
